{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：X在S05（18秒）等短时段仍堆了较多感受词，部分意象如“年少时初恋”“多年后走进旧房子”跳得较远，容易增加理解负担。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"X\",\n    \"point\": \"X\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"X\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"X用【】凸显叙事关键，让人可以先抓住每段发生了什么，再通过小字和按乐句出现的感受补充情绪变化，边听边扫更容易建立层次。水波、摇荡、船与靠岸等反复出现的意象，也让不同段落之间有连续的情绪线索，感受比Y更细腻具体。Y的因果解释在部分地方更完整，尤其S05把他暴露心意后为什么害怕、为什么觉得亲近变得隔了一层交代得更清楚，这是X比较明显的损失。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "06ae5b43-f354-450b-8af3-cb815b68c9be", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261107T231745350794Z", "elapsed_seconds": 98.718, "completed_utc": "2026-11-07T23:19:24.085329+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "145b6ae7e09b9c82c54d46f0f63c6713d157bab7b088f23407672e4d95dafa27", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt